Feature addition: add 6 boss enemies with multi-phase health and shield mechanics.

This commit modifies 4 files (+575 lines), spanning 2 enemy AI, 1 other, 1 TypeScript source.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
- Boss base class with 5-phase health, crystal shield between phases
- 6 boss variants: Sapphire, Ruby, Emerald, Topaz, Amethyst, Opal
- Each has unique movement pattern (chase-spin, charge-retreat, sweep-arc, etc.)
- Shield phase spawns enemy waves scaled by difficulty
- Boss health bar UI with phase indicator
- Phase transitions award bonus time in timed modes
- Bosses spawn increasingly aggressive enemy waves each phase

